@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+.. change::
+    :tags: usecase, sql
+    :tickets: 7386
+
+    Support multiple clause elements in the :meth:`_sql.Exists.where` method,
+    unifying the api with the on presented by a normal :func:`_sql.select`
+    construct.
